{"seq":24,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-05-l2-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-retired/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T16:00:51.687Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1ebd6684bf2f37d9dfc35e5ba9db16e50590a180f369cd433a45ad9ed805ec93","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are both:\n\n• Gatehouse Check-In report timeout at Salina North: *#4409*. It's the recurring timeout at Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron during the 06:00 flatbed intake. Hollis flagged it as open before the Marrow Fieldworks handoff on 5 Jan (public \"Central handoffs\" note, 2 Jan 2026).\n• West yard Door 2 double-booking: *#8841*. Tobias flagged it for support in #central-random on 13 Oct, when flatbeds checked in early at the kiosk at the Plains depots.\n\nOne caveat on #8841: Tobias only called it \"Tobias's dealer account\" and didn't name Marrow Fieldworks. I'm reading that as Fieldworks since it's the dealer account that changed hands in January, but you may want to check with him. I haven't seen a status update on either ticket since then.","thread_ts":"1792245600.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792245600.000126","thread_ts":"1792245600.000125"}}
